{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "DailyEventResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}/daily-event` 的回應（S10，#26）。\n\n`source` 區分內容從哪一層保底鏈路來的（今天的快取／前一天的快取／\n人工預寫），純粹方便觀察，客戶端不需要據此改變行為——三種情況對\n玩家來說都是「看到一段當日情境文字」，沒有分支要處理。",
        "properties": {
          "event_date": {
            "format": "date",
            "title": "Event Date",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "narrative_text": {
            "title": "Narrative Text",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "place_id": {
            "title": "Place Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "enum": [
              "cached_today",
              "cached_previous_day",
              "fallback"
            ],
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "place_id",
          "event_date",
          "narrative_text",
          "source"
        ],
        "title": "DailyEventResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DialogueRequest": {
        "description": "對話請求（SDD 第8.5節）。\n\n`user_input` 的長度上限先用保守值。SDD 提到 `prompt_max_chars` 會依實測調整，\n但那要等真的接上 Gemini、看到成本數據之後才有依據。",
        "properties": {
          "user_input": {
            "maxLength": 500,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "User Input",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "user_input"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DialogueResponse": {
        "description": "對話回應。\n\n⚠️ **這是走通端到端用的最小版本**，目前只做 B12 快速問候比對——命中回預寫\n台詞，未命中回人工預寫的 fallback。完整版（Gemini 生成、TTS 語音、安全邊界、\nPrompt 組裝）見 issue #42／#45。\n\n`tts` 欄位刻意還不存在：SDD v2.1 §10.1 定義它只含 `audio_url`，等 B10（#21）\n落地才會加上。現在放一個永遠是 null 的欄位只會讓客戶端寫出無用的處理分支。",
        "properties": {
          "reply_text": {
            "title": "Reply Text",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "reply_text",
          "source"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "description": "統一的錯誤回應契約模型（#30）。\n\n形狀對齊 FastAPI `HTTPException` 既有的 `{\"detail\": ...}`——這裡只是讓\n契約描述它，**不改變任何現有錯誤的實際 JSON 形狀**。自動觸發的 422\n驗證錯誤形狀不同（`detail` 是陣列），不用這個模型，FastAPI 已經自動\n宣告過。",
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "detail"
        ],
        "title": "ErrorResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "HTTPValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "OrientationResponse": {
        "description": "SDD v2.1 §10.2：靈魂相對召喚點的方位設定，供客戶端 3DoF 定向服務使用。\n\n包成巢狀物件而不是兩個平鋪欄位，讓客戶端能把「方位設定」當成一個可\n整包傳給 `OrientationService` 的值，對齊 SDD 的回應範例。",
        "properties": {
          "bearing_deg": {
            "title": "Bearing Deg",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "height_offset_m": {
            "title": "Height Offset M",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "bearing_deg",
          "height_offset_m"
        ],
        "title": "OrientationResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerCreateRequest": {
        "description": "App 首次啟動時呼叫。device_id 由 App 產生並存在裝置安全儲存區\n（對應 CONTEXT.md「匿名玩家」定義），這裡不接受任何硬體裝置 ID 當替代。",
        "properties": {
          "device_id": {
            "maxLength": 128,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device_id"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerCreateRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerResponse": {
        "description": "`POST /api/v1/players` 的回應。\n\n`account_id` 是對外契約，對應 DB 的 `auth_provider_id`（0003 改的名）。\nclient 的 `PlayerDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"account_id\")]` 寫死了這個 key。\n\n綁定流程做起來的時候，這裡應該一併把 `auth_provider` 也吐出去——\n只有「provider 那邊的 id」而不知道是哪一家 provider，資訊是不完整的。\n那一次改動要連 client 一起發版。",
        "properties": {
          "account_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Account Id"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device_id": {
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "player_id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Player Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "session_token": {
            "title": "Session Token",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "player_id",
          "device_id",
          "account_id",
          "created_at",
          "session_token"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestCompleteRequest": {
        "description": "`POST /api/v1/quests/{questId}/complete` 的請求（SDD §7.5）。\n\n`completion_evidence` 目前不影響判定——完成條件是後端確定性規則\n（CONTEXT.md：不由 LLM 判定），而垂直切片階段的規則就是「帶著有效的\n相遇憑證送出」。欄位先收下來，等真的有需要驗證的證據型任務時再用；\n現在不收的話，客戶端之後要加回來又是一次破壞性變更。",
        "properties": {
          "completion_evidence": {
            "title": "Completion Evidence",
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "title": "QuestCompleteRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestCompleteResponse": {
        "description": "SDD §7.5 的完成回應。\n\n`quest_wrapper_text` 與 `unlock_story` **在這張票（#34）永遠是 null**\n——它們需要腦袋生成（B11／B2），拆給 #43。§7.5 本來就允許\n`unlock_story` 為 null，所以這是合法的完整回應，不是半成品。",
        "properties": {
          "quest_wrapper_text": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Quest Wrapper Text"
          },
          "resonance_value": {
            "title": "Resonance Value",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "unlock_story": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Unlock Story"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "resonance_value"
        ],
        "title": "QuestCompleteResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestStateResponse": {
        "description": "SDD 第8.4節的 `quest` 欄位。\n\n`status` 可能是 `in_progress` / `completed` / `daily_limit_reached`，\n最後一個只存在於回應中，不是資料庫狀態（見 models.QuestProgress）。\n\n型別是 `Literal` 而不是裸 `str`：契約凍結前（#30）這三個值只活在中文\n註解裡，OpenAPI 產出的是無型別的 `string`，client 端拿不到 enum，也\n無法用編譯器擋住打錯字的魔術字串。",
        "properties": {
          "attempts_today": {
            "title": "Attempts Today",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "quest_id": {
            "title": "Quest Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "in_progress",
              "completed",
              "daily_limit_reached"
            ],
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quest_id",
          "status",
          "attempts_today"
        ],
        "title": "QuestStateResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseRequest": {
        "description": "S2-new．感應範圍驗證請求（SDD 第8.3節）。\n\n刻意**不**收 `gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location`：那兩個欄位是給 S3 防作弊\n觀察期用的，而觀察期記錄的是「在場」——CONTEXT.md 對在場紀錄的定義是完成\n在場驗證所需的地標與時間，感應範圍不構成在場。150 公尺外的一次感應不該產生\n任何可用來推測玩家位置的紀錄。",
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SenseRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "sense_token": {
            "title": "Sense Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sense_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SenseResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SpiritResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}` 的回應。\n\n**欄位名是對外契約，跟資料庫欄位名脫鉤。** 0002 把 DB 欄位改成\n`spirit_id` / `display_name` / `*_radius_meters` 之後，這裡靠\n`validation_alias` 從 ORM 物件讀新名字，但輸出仍是舊的 JSON key——\nUnity client 的 `SpiritDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"place_id\")]` 寫死了那些\n名字，改動等於要發一版客戶端。\n\n改 DB 欄位名不需要動客戶端，這正是兩者脫鉤的用途；反過來說，**要改這裡的\n欄位名時，必須連同 client 一起改**。\n\n`orientation` 不能靠 `from_attributes` 自動從 ORM 物件的平面欄位長出來\n——router 端改成明確用關鍵字建構這個 model（其他回應本來就是這樣寫）。",
        "properties": {
          "is_active": {
            "title": "Is Active",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "orientation": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrientationResponse"
          },
          "place_id": {
            "title": "Place Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sense_radius_m": {
            "title": "Sense Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "summon_radius_m": {
            "title": "Summon Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "place_id",
          "name",
          "latitude",
          "longitude",
          "summon_radius_m",
          "sense_radius_m",
          "is_active",
          "orientation"
        ],
        "title": "SpiritResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonRequest": {
        "description": "S2．在場驗證請求（SDD 第8.4節）。\n\n`gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location` 供 S3 防作弊觀察期使用\n（見 `anticheat.py`）：偵測到只記 log，不影響這次召喚的結果。",
        "properties": {
          "gps_accuracy_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Gps Accuracy M"
          },
          "is_mock_location": {
            "default": false,
            "title": "Is Mock Location",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SummonRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "encounter_token": {
            "title": "Encounter Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quest": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestStateResponse"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "encounter_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SummonResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Location",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "msg": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "title": "Error Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "HTTPBearer": {
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "type": "http"
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "title": "城市靈魂 AR — Backend",
    "version": "0.1.0-sprint1"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/players": {
      "post": {
        "description": "S6．匿名玩家身分系統。\n\n同一個 device_id 重複呼叫要回傳同一個 player（不能每次開 App 都產生新玩家），\n這是「App 首次啟動產生、保存於裝置安全儲存區」這條定義的自然結果——\n裝置端只要遺失 install_id 才會走到「升級綁定帳號」的路徑，不在這支 API 範圍內。\n\n每次呼叫（不論新建或既有玩家）都重新核發一張 session token（SDD第6節：\n重複呼叫「重新核發」，順便延長效期，玩家不會感覺到任何登入過期）。",
        "operationId": "create_or_get_player_api_v1_players_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlayerCreateRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlayerResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Create Or Get Player",
        "tags": [
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/quests/{quest_id}/complete": {
      "post": {
        "description": "S4／S5．任務完成與共鳴入帳（SDD §7.5 前半，#34）。\n\n需要 Session Token ＋ **Encounter Token**。持 Sense Token 者不可呼叫這支\n（SDD 第6節）——那張憑證只證明「在 150m 感應範圍內」，而挑戰任務要求\n真的到現場（50m）。這裡不接受 `X-Sense-Token`，沒有另外寫檢查：\n`require_encounter_token` 用的是 encounter 的金鑰與 `purpose` claim，\nsense token 本來就過不了。\n\n`unlock_story` 與 `quest_wrapper_text` 一律回 `null`——敘事生成屬 #43。",
        "operationId": "complete_quest_endpoint_api_v1_quests__quest_id__complete_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "quest_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Quest Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "X-Encounter-Token",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Encounter-Token"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestCompleteRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestCompleteResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Missing or invalid token"
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Not within required radius or token mismatch"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Spirit not found or inactive"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Complete Quest Endpoint",
        "tags": [
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sense": {
      "post": {
        "description": "S2-new．感應範圍驗證（SDD 第8.3節）。\n\n跟 `/summon` 長得很像，但**行為上少了三件事**，而那三件事正是它存在的理由：\n\n1. **不跑 S3 防作弊觀察期。** 觀察期記的是「在場」，而 CONTEXT.md 對在場\n   紀錄的定義是完成在場驗證所需的地標與時間——150 公尺外不構成在場。\n2. **不做任何任務判定、不核發任務**（SDD 第7.2節）。這是與 `/summon`\n   最關鍵的行為差異：呼叫這支不會建立或修改任何 `quest_progress` 列。\n3. **不核發 encounter token。** 感應憑證換不到在場證明，玩家還是得走過去。\n\n共用的只有純函式（距離計算）與 session 驗證。token 的核發與驗證邏輯\n完全獨立，見 `sense_tokens.py` 的模組註解。",
        "operationId": "sense_api_v1_sense_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SenseRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SenseResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Missing or invalid token"
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Not within required radius or token mismatch"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
